card\" data-indexcard=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/videos/ckg2qw59l07o\" data-testid=\"internal-link\"><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-video\"><div data-testid=\"card-media-wrapper\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\"><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260407-092955-f3cfe0ee04-web-3.0.0-2/grey-placeholder.png\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"><img sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 20vw, (min-width: 1008px) 25vw, (min-width: 800px) 33vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/8db9/live/9185b940-a395-11f0-92db-77261a15b9d2.png.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/8db9/live/9185b940-a395-11f0-92db-77261a15b9d2.png.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/8db9/live/9185b940-a395-11f0-92db-77261a15b9d2.png.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/8db9/live/9185b940-a395-11f0-92db-77261a15b9d2.png.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/8db9/live/9185b940-a395-11f0-92db-77261a15b9d2.png.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/8db9/live/9185b940-a395-11f0-92db-77261a15b9d2.png.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/8db9/live/9185b940-a395-11f0-92db-77261a15b9d2.png.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/8db9/live/9185b940-a395-11f0-92db-77261a15b9d2.png.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Three Israeli protestors stand in a row holding up posters of hostages who are still being held captive in Gaza. The left poster reads &quot;two years&quot; in yellow letters, with a photo of a man with glasses and dark hair. The middle poster says &quot;48 hostages&quot; in red letters and shows a picture of a young man with stubble and a fade haircut. The poster on the right also reads &quot;two years&quot; in black letters, and shows a 21 year old man. Every poster has the name of each hostage in Hebrew.\"></p></div></div><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\"><div><p><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\">What we know about the hostages still in Gaza</h2></p></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\">Two years after the 7 October attacks, dozens of hostages remain in Hamas captivity. BBC Verify has been examining what we know about them. </p><p><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\">BBC Verify</span></p></div></div></a></div><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/videos/crme42nr8exo\" data-testid=\"internal-link\"><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-video\"><div data-testid=\"card-media-wrapper\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\"><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260407-092955-f3cfe0ee04-web-3.0.0-2/grey-placeholder.png\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"><img sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 20vw, (min-width: 1008px) 25vw, (min-width: 800px) 33vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/7a07/live/793f7ea0-94d3-11f0-84c8-99de564f0440.png.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/7a07/live/793f7ea0-94d3-11f0-84c8-99de564f0440.png.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/7a07/live/793f7ea0-94d3-11f0-84c8-99de564f0440.png.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/7a07/live/793f7ea0-94d3-11f0-84c8-99de564f0440.png.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/7a07/live/793f7ea0-94d3-11f0-84c8-99de564f0440.png.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/7a07/live/793f7ea0-94d3-11f0-84c8-99de564f0440.png.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/7a07/live/793f7ea0-94d3-11f0-84c8-99de564f0440.png.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/7a07/live/793f7ea0-94d3-11f0-84c8-99de564f0440.png.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Jimmy Kimmel\"></p></div></div><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\"><div><p><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\">Ros Atkins on… What Kimmel's suspension means for free speech in the US</h2></p></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\">The BBC's analysis editor looks at a decision that leading Democrats have called \"an abuse of power\".\n</p><p><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\">BBC Verify</span></p></div></div></a></div><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/videos/c17rkyjv8g9o\" data-testid=\"internal-link\"><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-video\"><div data-testid=\"card-media-wrapper\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\"><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260407-092955-f3cfe0ee04-web-3.0.0-2/grey-placeholder.png\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"><img sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 20vw, (min-width: 1008px) 25vw, (min-width: 800px) 33vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/e3ec/live/fb46fa20-47b9-11f0-84b6-6bf0f66205f1.png.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/e3ec/live/fb46fa20-47b9-11f0-84b6-6bf0f66205f1.png.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/e3ec/live/fb46fa20-47b9-11f0-84b6-6bf0f66205f1.png.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/e3ec/live/fb46fa20-47b9-11f0-84b6-6bf0f66205f1.png.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/e3ec/live/fb46fa20-47b9-11f0-84b6-6bf0f66205f1.png.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/e3ec/live/fb46fa20-47b9-11f0-84b6-6bf0f66205f1.png.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/e3ec/live/fb46fa20-47b9-11f0-84b6-6bf0f66205f1.png.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/e3ec/live/fb46fa20-47b9-11f0-84b6-6bf0f66205f1.png.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"A blue and green composite image that shows a 3D model of the Air India plane and a screengrab of the plane taking off from the runway. In the top left hand corner is the BBC Verify logo.\"></p></div></div><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\"><div><p><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\">What video and flight data tell us about Air India crash</h2></p></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\">Using footage and flight data, BBC Verify has pieced together what we know so far about the Air India crash in Ahmedabad.</p><p><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\">BBC Verify</span></p></div></div></a></div><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/videos/c30851r3516o\" data-testid=\"internal-link\"><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-video\"><div data-testid=\"card-media-wrapper\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\"><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260407-092955-f3cfe0ee04-web-3.0.0-2/grey-placeholder.png\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"><img sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 20vw, (min-width: 1008px) 25vw, (min-width: 800px) 33vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/4ef8/live/e0a19bb0-469e-11f0-9471-e380f647874e.png.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/4ef8/live/e0a19bb0-469e-11f0-9471-e380f647874e.png.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/4ef8/live/e0a19bb0-469e-11f0-9471-e380f647874e.png.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/4ef8/live/e0a19bb0-469e-11f0-9471-e380f647874e.png.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/4ef8/live/e0a19bb0-469e-11f0-9471-e380f647874e.png.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/4ef8/live/e0a19bb0-469e-11f0-9471-e380f647874e.png.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/4ef8/live/e0a19bb0-469e-11f0-9471-e380f647874e.png.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/4ef8/live/e0a19bb0-469e-11f0-9471-e380f647874e.png.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"In the foreground is UK Chancellor Rachel Reeves, with the BBC Verify logo in the top right hand corner.\"></p></div></div><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\"><div><p><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\">Spending Review: What can we expect?</h2></p></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\">The review will reveal the choices the government has made about where to allocate cash over the next three years.\n</p><p><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\">BBC Verify</span></p></div></div></a></div><div